{"id":"ikbta9htqzdavlan4k44r18hy","title":"管理者应对员工心理健康问题的实用建议","originalTitle":"Practical advice for managers when employees experience mental health problems","summary":"瑞典哥德堡大学公共健康科学副教授 Monica Bertilsson 领导的研究团队发布了一项指南，旨在支持管理者应对员工的心理健康问题。该指南基于对管理者经验的总结，提供了实用的建议，包括建立信任、实施工作调整、制定行动计划等。研究结果发表在《康复医学》杂志上。","reason":null,"source":{"name":"Phys.org"},"links":{"original":"https://phys.org/news/2026-11-advice-employees-mental-health-problems.html"},"publishedAt":"2026-11-19T13:30:02.000Z","discoveredAt":"2026-11-19T16:17:51.685Z","timelineAt":"2026-11-19T16:17:51.685Z","category":"clinical","tags":["论文发表","DeepMind"],"score":31,"selected":false,"channel":"news","story":{"publicId":"177a0ef8-c936-4807-a2da-4d3080798477","title":"瑞典哥德堡大学发布管理者应对员工心理健康问题指南"},"x":null,"readingMode":"full","author":null,"body":null,"outline":[],"relatedStories":[{"publicId":"177a0ef8-c936-4807-a2da-4d3080798477","title":"瑞典哥德堡大学发布管理者应对员工心理健康问题指南"}],"topics":[{"slug":"deepmind","name":"DeepMind"},{"slug":"conference-paper","name":"顶会与论文接收"}],"indexable":false,"markdownAvailable":true,"group":{"factId":"fmtxhWE_PyrU","reportCount":1,"additionalSourceCount":0},"hasTranslation":false,"bodyLanguage":"original"}